  "description": "Infuse your designs with charming artisan craft energy, whimsical hand-lettered warmth, and personal touch with HANDMADE MONOGRAM, a playful style font! Crafted with tall, narrow character proportions, soft organic stroke contours, and subtle marker-style variations, this versatile display typeface brings an authentic handmade feel to every title. A fantastic choice for craft vinyl projects, custom monograms, boutique product packaging, wedding favor tags, greeting cards, DIY crafting logos, and aesthetic quote designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Infuse your designs with charming artisan craft energy, whimsical hand-lettered warmth, and personal touch with HANDMADE MONOGRAM, a playful style font! Crafted with tall, narrow character proportions, soft organic stroke contours, and subtle marker-style variations, this versatile display typeface brings an authentic handmade feel to every title. A fantastic choice for craft vinyl projects, custom monograms, boutique product packaging, wedding favor tags, greeting cards, DIY crafting logos, and aesthetic quote designs.</p>",
